<?xml version="1.0" encoding="windows-1251"?>
<!-- Anomaly Coop: co-op window of the main menu (scripts\coop_menu.script), redesign 2026-10-23 after the mockup
     docs\hud\coop_menu_mockup.png. One 896x560 window in the 1024x768 UI space (4:3). On a wide screen the engine loads
     ui_coop_menu_16.xml instead, made from this file by tools\make_menu_layout_16.py (x and width times 0.75): edit THIS
     file, then run the tool (the Lua test fails when they drift apart). Captions are string ids
     (configs\text\*\st_coop_menu.xml).

     Everything flat is the solid white cell coop_menu_white of the atlas textures\ui\coop\ui_coop_menu.dds (see
     tools\make_menu_icons.py) stretched and tinted by the <texture r g b a> of the node; the script re-tints a node
     when its state changes. Palette: window 20 20 19, border 58 58 56, sand 217 177 96, text 226 224 216, grey 140 138 130.
       *_b     a 1-unit frame: the same rectangle one unit larger under the fill, in the border colour
       *_f     the fill, carries the caption of a segment or of a flat button
       btn_*   a button that has no look of its own: coop_menu_hit is transparent, with a white veil under the cursor
               (the 3-state button reads coop_menu_hit_e / _d / _h / _t); drawn above the statics it belongs to.
               Flat buttons keep their caption here, its colours per state are <text_color>.
     The nodes are drawn in the order the script creates them (bottom to top). -->
<!-- 16:9 version of ui_coop_menu.xml, made by tools\make_menu_layout_16.py (do not edit by hand: edit the 4:3 file and run
     the tool). The engine loads it instead of the 4:3 file on a wide screen. x and width of everything inside the window
     are those of the 4:3 file times 0.75 (the stock *_16.xml way), the window is centred; y and height are the same. -->
